exp2/**
*.pyc
# Everything the daemon writes at runtime. A directory, not a list of
# paths: enumerating them meant a new one (notes/) was tracked by
# default, and an operator's private repo notes were committed.
# That includes sessions/: one private omp session directory per worker
# run, pruned to the newest SESSIONS_RETAINED by the harness itself.
hunter/data/
__pycache__/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
hunter/node_modules/
hunter/ui/
